Subject: [PATCH] m32r: Fix ei_tx_timeout() in drivers/net/lib8390.c
User-Agent: Wanderlust/2.14.0 (Africa) Emacs/21.4 Mule/5.0 (SAKAKI)
Renesas-ECN: H07-0010RT
MIME-Version: 1.0 (generated by SEMI 1.14.6 - "Maruoka")
